{
  "extension": "devicePaths",
  "description": "客户端用户主动选择设备上的目录或文件；只列目录项及必要元数据，不读取文件内容，不作为模型工具。类型见 packages/protocol/src/path-picker.mts。",
  "declaration": {
    "where": "initialize.params.capabilities.litchExtensions",
    "schema": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": { "type": "string" },
      "contains": { "const": "devicePaths" }
    }
  },
  "undeclared": "拒绝 litch/paths/list；不发送额外通知。旧服务未声明此能力时，客户端提示只能手填或升级设备服务。",
  "rules": [
    "仅在用户打开路径选择器或跳转目录后调用。不改 files.list 的项目根校验，不授予读取文件内容、写文件或执行命令的能力。",
    "path=null 从目标设备主目录开始；~、~/ 在目标设备上展开。只接受已有的绝对目录，不接受普通相对路径。",
    "复用 fs/readDirectory 读取目录项；对每项补充 lstat/stat 和可执行判断。kind 保留 link，targetKind 指明链接目标类型；失效链接 targetKind=null。POSIX executable 按当前设备服务用户的 X_OK 检查，Windows 按设备的 PATHEXT 判断；不执行文件。",
    "一页最多返回 2000 项，超出时 truncated=true、total 保留总数，客户端提示仍可手填。并发元数据检查最多 8 项。"
  ],
  "parts": [
    {
      "kind": "ClientRequest",
      "method": "litch/paths/list",
      "params": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["path"],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": { "path": { "type": ["string", "null"] } }
      },
      "response": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["path", "parent", "entries", "total", "truncated"],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "path": { "type": "string" },
          "parent": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
          "total": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
          "truncated": { "type": "boolean" },
          "entries": {
            "type": "array",
            "maxItems": 2000,
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": ["name", "kind", "targetKind", "executable"],
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "name": { "type": "string" },
                "kind": { "enum": ["dir", "file", "link", "other"] },
                "targetKind": { "enum": ["dir", "file", null] },
                "executable": { "type": ["boolean", "null"] }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
